The moderate‑gain PD on the pole angle, combined with *delayed* and *soft* cart‑centering, gave the best performance so far. The revised rule‑set tightens the thresholds, reduces the aggressiveness of the cart‑position controller, and adds a very light “centering‑only” mode for the calmest states. This should raise the average episode length beyond the previous best of 17.6 / 1000.
            
