The **new thresholds** (`x_thr = 0.30 m` instead of 0.45‑0.50 m) make the cart‑position controller engage **earlier**, while the **higher position gain** (`kx = 1.4` vs. 1.2‑1.5 before) gives enough authority without hitting the ±3 N limit most of the time.  

