I propose a **single‑layer linear‑feedback controller with soft saturation**, plus a tiny “fallback” bias that only activates when everything else is already very small. The gains are chosen by hand to respect the force limits (±3 N) and to give a faster response on the angle while still keeping the cart near the centre.

