* The **piece‑wise** controller was the best so far, but its large‑angle gains were too aggressive.  
* I introduced a **dead‑zone**, **four angle bands**, **softer cart‑centering**, and **moderated pole gains**.  
* The new pseudocode above should keep the pole upright longer (target ≥ 30 seconds on average) while staying within the ±3 N force limits.
