| **Dead‑zone (|θ| < 0.01 rad)** | Removes high‑frequency jitter when the pole is already very close to vertical, which otherwise would waste the limited force budget. |
| **`tanh` after gain** | Gives a smooth transition into the hard limits, avoiding sudden “bang‑bang” spikes that can push the cart to the edge of the track. |
| **Never ignore `x`** | The cart is gently nudged back toward the centre, preventing the slow drift observed in the best‑so‑far strategy. |

