| Component | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| **Safety guard** | Prevents NaNs from propagating. |
| **Emergency push only for |θ| ≥ 0.19** | Gives the controller a chance to correct with the LQR term up to the very edge of the failure band; the push is used only when the pole is already almost out of bounds. |
