| At |θ| ≈ 0.19 rad the controller applied the maximum opposite force (‑3 N) but the pole still fell a few steps later. | With `scale_angle` ≈ 2 the angle term dominates, but the cart term still provides a small corrective bias, helping to keep the cart from hitting the track edge. |

