| Emergency hard‑stop (`|θ|≥0.18` → `force = clamp(-sign(θ)*3,…)`) | Guarantees maximal corrective effort when the pole is close to the failure limit. |
| Very narrow cart‑only band (`|θ|≤0.02`) | When the pole is almost upright the cart‑position controller can act without fighting the dominant angle dynamics. |
| Linear scaling of the angle‑only gain (`scale = 1 + (|θ|-0.02)/(0.18-0.02)`, clipped to [1,2]) | Provides a smooth increase of corrective torque as the pole tilts. |

| Change / Add | Rationale |
