| **Current (simple blend)** | **22.5** | When |θ| ≈ 0.02 the controller switches abruptly from a weak cart‑position PD to a strong angle‑PD. The force often saturates at ±3 N too early, causing the pole to be driven hard even when a gentler correction would suffice. |
