**Bottom line:**  
The **quadratically‑scaled angle controller with a fading cart term and smooth tanh saturation** is the most promising rule set based on the observed data. Implement the pseudocode above as the new policy; it should keep the pole upright noticeably longer than any of the previous attempts.
