| **Hard‑stop only when |θ| ≥ θ_max** | The fallback “‑3 · sign(θ)” is kept as a safety net, but it is reached far less often because the scaled controller already supplies most of the needed force. |
| **Clipping** | Guarantees the action stays inside the allowed range, avoiding NaNs. |

