*If the pole ever reaches the hard limit* (|θ| ≥ 0.18) the fallback rule fires, delivering the maximum possible opposite push to try to rescue the episode. In practice this situation should be rare; most episodes will terminate because the pole has already left the ±0.2 rad safety window, not because the controller hit the max‑force rule.

