|------|-------------------|
| Keep forces tiny when the pole is almost upright (`|θ| < 0.02`) | Use a “dead‑zone” controller that only corrects cart drift (`‑k₁·x – k₂·ẋ`). |
| Increase corrective effort smoothly as the pole tilts | Define a gain factor `g(θ) ∈ [1, 2]` that grows linearly from `|θ| = 0.02` to `|θ| = 0.18`. |
