| 1    | –0.01 , 0.04 , ‑0.33 , 0.73 | 1.0 (|θ|>full_angle) | +≈ 12 N | –≈ 0.2 N | +≈ 11.8 N | **+3.0 N** (saturated) |
| 2    | –0.03 , 0.07 , ‑0.36 , 0.80 | 1.0 | +≈ 13 N | –≈ 0.3 N | +≈ 12.7 N | **+3.0 N** |
