      direction the pole is falling.
   -------------------------------------------------------------- */
ff_gain  ← 1.2 * tilt
ff_term  ← -ff_gain * theta_dot * SIGN(theta)   // SIGN(θ) = +1 if θ>0, –1 if θ<0

