| Typical failure mode | Immediate fall – gains too low | Slightly later fall – still linear PD | Drift of cart + insufficient torque at larger angles | Cart drift eliminated, torque strong enough for ±0.2 rad |
| Main missing element (identified) | No tilt‑dependent gains | Same | No non‑linear pole term, weak centre bias, no gravity feed‑forward | Added all three |

