The new rule‑set keeps the proven pole‑PD, adds a well‑behaved cart‑centering PI, and uses a modest gravity feed‑forward.  This should raise the average episode length from the current ~45 % of the horizon to well above 70 % (≈ 700 steps) and give us a solid baseline for further fine‑tuning.
            
