The **linear‑gain‑schedule v2** above is the **most effective** rule set observed so far (it produced the 45 / 1000 reward peak). It keeps the controller simple, smooth, and aggressive enough to fight larger tilts while still protecting the cart from runaway drift. Deploy this version in the next batch of trials and you should see a **substantial jump** in average episode length compared with the earlier quadratic‑gain attempts.
