**1. What the data tells us**

| Strategy | Typical average reward (1000‑step episodes) | Typical behaviour |
|----------|--------------------------------------------|-------------------|
| **Strategy A** (the most recent, with many gain‑tweaks and an integral term) | **≈ 5 / 1000** | The controller quickly saturates at ±3 N, the pole falls after a few hundred steps. The extra integral term and the aggressive “gravity‑ff” (≈ 95 % of g sinθ) make the command too strong when the pole is already close to the limits. |
