gravity_ff←  9.81 * sin(theta)                // cancels static torque
cart_pd   ← -( Kp_cart * x + Kd_cart * x_dot ) // keep cart near centre

/* -------------------------------------------------------------
   5. Raw command and smooth saturation
      • The tanh non‑linearity keeps the command inside [-3, +3].
      • Scaling factor 3.0 maps tanh≈±1 to the physical force limit.
   ------------------------------------------------------------- */
