| **Gravity term (`u_grav`)** | Cancels the constant torque of the pole’s weight, turning the problem into a pure PD regulation task. |
| **Integral on θ (bounded)** | Eliminates the slow drift that caused the cart to wander to the edge of the track in the best‑so‑far runs. |
| **Soft‑clip with `tanh(u_raw/1.0)`** | Provides smooth actuation (no jerky jumps) while still allowing the full ±3 N when needed. |
