            The task description is: 
        Consider that you are embodied in the following agent and environment. 
        
        Agent: A cart over a track that has an unactuated pole attached to it. A continuous force can be applied to the cart, left or right, to counteract the passive movement of the pole.
        
        Goal: make the pole stand upright (within a certain angle limit) as long as possible - as such a reward of +1 is awarded for each timestep that the pole is upright.

        Observation state: A 4D vector in the following order:

        Cart position (meters): -Infinite to Infinite;
        Pole angle (radians): -Infinite to Infinite;
        Cart velocity (meters per second): -Infinite to Infinite;
        Pole angular velocity (radians per second): -Infinite to Infinite;
        
        Action (Force N): float value from -3.0 to 3.0 

        Failure Conditions: 
           - The pole angle is less than -0.2 radians or greater than 0.2 radians.
           - Any of the state space values is no longer finite.
        
                        
            Here are a set of IF-THEN-ELSE rules for choosing the action based on the observation variables.
            
            IF NOT (isfinite(x) AND isfinite(x_dot) AND isfinite(theta) AND isfinite(theta_dot)) THEN force = 0  
ELSE  
    u = -(35.0 * theta + 6.0 * theta_dot) - (0.5 * x + 0.1 * x_dot)  
    IF u > 3.0 THEN force = 3.0  
    ELSE IF u < -3.0 THEN force = -3.0  
    ELSE IF abs(u) < 0.02 THEN force = 0.0  
    ELSE force = u   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF   END IF  